{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54481","headline":"兵要望江南 风角第二（辛本作「占风角第二」、京本作「占风第三」。三十三首） 一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 风角第二（辛本作「占风角第二」、京本作「占风第三」。三十三首） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兴兵道，风角最爲先。\n若是逆风（辛本、川本作「迎风」）权且住，後来风助合苍天，大战我当先。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54481.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54481","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}